{
  "id": "old-town",
  "city": "bangkok",
  "name": {
    "en": "Old Town (Rattanakosin)"
  },
  "tagline": {
    "en": "The Grand Palace, Wat Pho and Khao San Road. History first, then a beer."
  },
  "about": {
    "en": "Rattanakosin is the old royal island between the Chao Phraya and the canals, with the Grand Palace, Wat Phra Kaew and Wat Pho at its heart and Wat Arun across the river. There is no BTS here; the MRT Blue line reaches Sanam Chai, and the river boats stop at Tha Tien and Tha Chang. Banglamphu and Khao San Road to the north are the guesthouse quarter, cheap and loud at night. Come for the temples, stay if you like walking and boats more than trains."
  },
